Package: neclassflows
Title: Tools to Analyze Cross-National Reporting and Entity Flows
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Tobias", "Schmidt", email = "tobias3.schmidt@tu-dortmund.de", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Helpers for cleaning, aggregating and analyzing reporting flows across countries and entity classes. Provides label harmonization, article-level matrices, period-level aggregations, and thresholded document hit counts.
